<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Gruntal ups Faulding.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Gruntal ups Faulding.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Gruntal Investment Research said analyst David Saks upgraded generic drug company Faulding Inc to long-term outperform from neutral, with a two-year $12 price target.</p>
<p>-- In a report Saks cited a &quot;depressed&quot; share price and recent positive changes at the company.</p>
<p>-- The stock was up 3/8 at 6-1/8.</p>
</text>
